  m_text: "GAME CREDITS\r\n\r\nGAME DEVELOPMENT\r\n\r\nGame Developer & Designer\r\nZesrias
    \u2014 Ryan Paolo Oquias\r\n\r\nProgramming & Game Design\r\nZesrias \u2014 Ryan
    Paolo Oquias\r\n\r\nART & UI\r\n\r\nCharacter & UI Design\r\nCy \u2014 Jericho
    Cyrus\r\nPopoyLapoy \u2014 Kane Joel Lacaba\r\n\r\nWORD CONTRIBUTORS\r\n\r\nBSEMC
    3A Class \u2014 2025\r\nSpecial thanks to our classmates who contributed word
    ideas and suggestions for the game.\r\n\r\nMEDIA & PROMOTION\r\n\r\nTrailer\r\nKane
    Joel Lacaba\r\n\r\nDemo Presentation\r\nCarl Martine Costillas\r\nMichelle Herrera\r\nLara
    Clarisse Alcedo\r\n\r\nPoster Design\r\nJericho Cyrus\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL ASSETS\r\n\r\nArt
    & Sprites\r\n\r\nPH Myth Creatures \u2014 Shade\r\nhttps://merchant-shade.itch.io/ph-myth-creatures\r\n\r\nCute
    Fantasy RPG \u2014 Kenmi\r\nhttps://kenmi-art.itch.io/cute-fantasy-rpg\r\nLicense:
    Non-Commercial\r\n\r\nUI\r\n\r\nAiryu UI\r\n\r\nMusic & Sound Effects\r\n\r\nHigh
    Quality 8-Bit Musics \u2014 Hydrogene\r\nhttps://hydrogene.itch.io/high-quality-8-bit-musics\r\n\r\nRPG
    Essentials SFX \u2014 Free \u2014 Leohpaz\r\nhttps://leohpaz.itch.io/rpg-essentials-sfx-free\r\n\r\nCamellina
    \u2014 RainyHearts\r\n\r\n8bit Music \u2014 AnnoyedCactus\r\n\r\nOriginal Composition
    \u2014 Mike Morasky\r\nReconstructing More Science\r\n\r\nFonts\r\n\r\nBold Pixel
    \u2014 YukiPixels\r\nhttps://yukipixels.itch.io/boldpixels\r\n\r\nM5x7 \u2014
    Managore\r\nhttps://managore.itch.io/m5x7\r\n\r\nINSTITUTIONAL CREDIT\r\n\r\nDeveloped
    as a student project at\r\nUniversity of Caloocan City (UCC)\r\n\r\nBachelor
    of Science in Entertainment and Multimedia Computing (BSEMC)\r\n\r\nSPECIAL THANKS\r\n\r\nOur
    classmates, instructors, and everyone who supported the development of this game.\r\n\r\nSpecial
    thanks to the BSEMC 3A Class of 2025 for their contributions, feedback, and word
    ideas.\r\n"
